event: thinking
data: {"id": "d65eecf4e12345ba-thinking-parallel_evidence-1079", "run_id": "d65eecf4e12345ba", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 证据结论\n\n### 已采集事实\n\n1. **Pod 当前状态**：`aiops-case-v02/workload` 处于 **Pending** 状态 (UID `49f4b3a0-c450-44f9-8baf-ce88e4ed74c4`)，未分配到任何节点 (`node: <none>`)，无 IP 地址。\n2. **调度器事件**：调度器 `default-scheduler` 连续两次触发 `FailedScheduling`，精确原因为 **`0/3 nodes are available: 3 Insufficient memory.`**，预emption 策略也失败（`No preemption victims found`）。\n3. **Pod 资源诉求**：容器 `app` 声明 `memory limit: 1Pi` (1 Petabyte = 1,125,899,906,842,624 Ki)，`cpu limit: 50m`。\n4. **集群资源基线**：集群 3 个节点 (master, node1, node2)，可分配内存总量最大约 32 Ti (", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 5, "ts_ms": 1789109623958, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "d65eecf4e12345ba-node_complete-parallel_evidence", "run_id": "d65eecf4e12345ba", "seq": 1080, "ts_ms": 1789109631171, "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "并发证据采集", "duration_seconds": 43.053, "state_snapshot": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-output.v2", "group_count": 1, "expected_group_count": 1, "terminal_group_count": 1, "join_complete": true, "diagnosed_count": 1, "inconclusive_count": 0, "error_count": 0, "errors": [], "groups": [{"group_id": "g1", "presentation_index": 0, "entities": [{"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-v02", "name": "workload"}], "diagnostic_status": "diagnosed", "artifact_ref": {"path": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/d65eecf4e12345ba-g1/lane_artifacts/g1/artifact.json", "sha256": "622b85096477dccb4a458146f1f21bf9b2dc885ad6e79c649fe51cc95c5d56d4", "bytes": 2568}, "snapshot_sha256": "df18c0b8ab4e7ca09e72c393cb442f2e2622191a034b91093f8dd1f498fd7510"}]}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: node_start
data: {"id": "d65eecf4e12345ba-node_start-conclusion", "run_id": "d65eecf4e12345ba", "seq": 1081, "ts_ms": 1789109631172, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "d65eecf4e12345ba-node_complete-conclusion", "run_id": "d65eecf4e12345ba", "seq": 1082, "ts_ms": 1789109639730, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结", "duration_seconds": 8.558, "state_snapshot": {"conclusion_length": 1450, "has_errors": false, "has_warnings": false, "conclusion": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v02/workload` | Pending | Pod内存请求量(1Pi)超过集群所有节点可分配内存上限，导致调度器无法找到合适节点分配该Pod。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `Pod (aiops-case-v02/workload)` 状态为 `Pending` (`fact-6b3b4a9377d6`) | 确认应用处于无法运行的停滞状态 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `FailedScheduling` 事件：`0/3 nodes are available: 3 Insufficient memory` (`fact-36e3d59c98da`, `fact-90a013dccddc`) | 证明集群所有节点均无法分配该资源，是 Pod 卡住的直接原因 |\n| 3 | K8s Config | Kubernetes | 内存资源请求 `container.resource_request.memory` 设置为 `1Pi` (`fact-e0d95c2a7411`)；内存硬限制 `container.resource_limit.memory` 设置为 `1Pi` (`fact-98ab64624256`) | 定位异常资源参数，1Pi 远超常规物理节点容量 |\n| 4 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_status_phase` 确认 `Pending` 值为 1，`Unknown` 值为 0 (`fact-667b33ca8e12`, `fact-34c0f994ce07`) | 辅助证实 Pod 停留在调度阶段，未进入运行或错误状态 |\n\n**证据分析：**\nKubernetes 调度器的 `Insufficient memory` 报错直接由 Pod 配置的 `1Pi` 内存请求导致。由于该资源量超过集群所有 3 个节点的 Allocatable Memory 上限，调度器无法找到可用节点（Preemption 机制也未能解决），从而导致 Pod 处于 `Pending` 状态。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod 配置 1Pi 内存请求 (fact-3) → 超过集群所有节点可分配上限 → 调度器无法分配资源 (fact-2) → Pod 状态 Pending (fact-1, fact-4)\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为：Pod `aiops-case-v02/workload` 的 `spec.containers[0].resources.requests.memory` 配置为 `1Pi`，该数值超过了集群所有可用节点（3 个）的内存容量上限。\n\n由于资源请求量不合理，Kubernetes 调度器无法找到任何节点满足该调度约束（Evidence: `fact-2`），导致 Pod 永远无法被调度至具体节点运行（Evidence: `fact-1`）。", "conclusion_formatted": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v02/workload` | Pending | Pod内存请求量(1Pi)超过集群所有节点可分配内存上限，导致调度器无法找到合适节点分配该Pod。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `Pod (aiops-case-v02/workload)` 状态为 `Pending` (`fact-6b3b4a9377d6`) | 确认应用处于无法运行的停滞状态 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `FailedScheduling` 事件：`0/3 nodes are available: 3 Insufficient memory` (`fact-36e3d59c98da`, `fact-90a013dccddc`) | 证明集群所有节点均无法分配该资源，是 Pod 卡住的直接原因 |\n| 3 | K8s Config | Kubernetes | 内存资源请求 `container.resource_request.memory` 设置为 `1Pi` (`fact-e0d95c2a7411`)；内存硬限制 `container.resource_limit.memory` 设置为 `1Pi` (`fact-98ab64624256`) | 定位异常资源参数，1Pi 远超常规物理节点容量 |\n| 4 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_status_phase` 确认 `Pending` 值为 1，`Unknown` 值为 0 (`fact-667b33ca8e12`, `fact-34c0f994ce07`) | 辅助证实 Pod 停留在调度阶段，未进入运行或错误状态 |\n\n**证据分析：**\nKubernetes 调度器的 `Insufficient memory` 报错直接由 Pod 配置的 `1Pi` 内存请求导致。由于该资源量超过集群所有 3 个节点的 Allocatable Memory 上限，调度器无法找到可用节点（Preemption 机制也未能解决），从而导致 Pod 处于 `Pending` 状态。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod 配置 1Pi 内存请求 (fact-3) → 超过集群所有节点可分配上限 → 调度器无法分配资源 (fact-2) → Pod 状态 Pending (fact-1, fact-4)\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为：Pod `aiops-case-v02/workload` 的 `spec.containers[0].resources.requests.memory` 配置为 `1Pi`，该数值超过了集群所有可用节点（3 个）的内存容量上限。\n\n由于资源请求量不合理，Kubernetes 调度器无法找到任何节点满足该调度约束（Evidence: `fact-2`），导致 Pod 永远无法被调度至具体节点运行（Evidence: `fact-1`）。"}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: final
data: {"id": "d65eecf4e12345ba-final", "run_id": "d65eecf4e12345ba", "seq": 1084, "ts_ms": 1789109639744, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v02/workload` | Pending | Pod内存请求量(1Pi)超过集群所有节点可分配内存上限，导致调度器无法找到合适节点分配该Pod。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `Pod (aiops-case-v02/workload)` 状态为 `Pending` (`fact-6b3b4a9377d6`) | 确认应用处于无法运行的停滞状态 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `FailedScheduling` 事件：`0/3 nodes are available: 3 Insufficient memory` (`fact-36e3d59c98da`, `fact-90a013dccddc`) | 证明集群所有节点均无法分配该资源，是 Pod 卡住的直接原因 |\n| 3 | K8s Config | Kubernetes | 内存资源请求 `container.resource_request.memory` 设置为 `1Pi` (`fact-e0d95c2a7411`)；内存硬限制 `container.resource_limit.memory` 设置为 `1Pi` (`fact-98ab64624256`) | 定位异常资源参数，1Pi 远超常规物理节点容量 |\n| 4 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_status_phase` 确认 `Pending` 值为 1，`Unknown` 值为 0 (`fact-667b33ca8e12`, `fact-34c0f994ce07`) | 辅助证实 Pod 停留在调度阶段，未进入运行或错误状态 |\n\n**证据分析：**\nKubernetes 调度器的 `Insufficient memory` 报错直接由 Pod 配置的 `1Pi` 内存请求导致。由于该资源量超过集群所有 3 个节点的 Allocatable Memory 上限，调度器无法找到可用节点（Preemption 机制也未能解决），从而导致 Pod 处于 `Pending` 状态。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod 配置 1Pi 内存请求 (fact-3) → 超过集群所有节点可分配上限 → 调度器无法分配资源 (fact-2) → Pod 状态 Pending (fact-1, fact-4)\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为：Pod `aiops-case-v02/workload` 的 `spec.containers[0].resources.requests.memory` 配置为 `1Pi`，该数值超过了集群所有可用节点（3 个）的内存容量上限。\n\n由于资源请求量不合理，Kubernetes 调度器无法找到任何节点满足该调度约束（Evidence: `fact-2`），导致 Pod 永远无法被调度至具体节点运行（Evidence: `fact-1`）。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.2m\n├─ 问题定位: 22.5s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 43.1s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v02/workload: 43.1s (Evidence 35.9s, RCA 7.1s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 8.6s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v02/workload**: pod-pending-unschedulable\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 74.12, "metrics": {"run_id": "d65eecf4e12345ba", "mttr": {"value": "1.2m", "seconds": 74.12532949447632, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "48%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-pending-unschedulable", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-pending-unschedulable"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 74125.32949447632, "llm_calls": 18, "llm_duration_ms": 64169.04926300049, "tool_calls": 17, "executed_tool_calls": 15, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 1, "successful_tool_calls": 16, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 19273.68688583374, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 9655.879259109497}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 22486.36817932129, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 43052.73914337158, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0